<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1556_5623.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unßer fründtlich willig dienst, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">samt</unclear> was wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehren</unclear> liebs
<lb n="2"/>und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guets</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermoegend</unclear>, zuvor, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">From</unclear>, Fürsichtig, Erßam, wyß,
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inßonders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guet</unclear> fründt und getrüw lieb <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear></orgName>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Uff</unclear>
<lb n="4"/>dato hat <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vilgeliebter</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getrüwer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mitrhat</unclear>, Herr
<lb n="5"/>Landtshouptman <persName resp="#ner">Niclaus <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schuller</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innamen</unclear> syn und der
<lb n="6"/>übrigen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Witwen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ratgebrüeder</unclear> fürgebracht und eroffnet,
<lb n="7"/>welchermaßen sy vor etwas <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abgloffner</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jaren</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwerem</unclear>
<lb n="8"/>Burger <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">J</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Leonhard</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Kellern</unclear></persName>, das Schloß <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Grüenenstein</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="9"/>samt aller <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darzue</unclear> habenden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rechtsamj</unclear> im <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-64" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rhÿnthall</unclear></placeName> gelegen,
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zekouffen</unclear> geben, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bÿ</unclear> welchem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kouff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inen</unclear> noch ein namhaffte
<lb n="11"/>summa gelts unbezalt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">usstande</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wÿl</unclear> aber <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angeregts</unclear>
<lb n="12"/>Schloß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sidhar</unclear>, von ime <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Kellern</unclear> an <persName resp="#ner">J. Sigmund <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zollik</unclear>-
<lb n="13"/>offern</persName> gewachßen, der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daßelbig</unclear> auch widerumb verkoufft
<lb n="14"/>und biß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fl</unclear>. 1500. mehr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sÿkouff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermoegen</unclear>,
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erloest</unclear>. So werden sÿ ohnangesehen deßen bericht,
<lb n="16"/>das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gesagts</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zollikoffers</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemeine</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Creditoren</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schuldgloübig</unclear>-
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ere</unclear> an ime <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verlieren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">müeßen</unclear>, da dießelben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verordnete</unclear>
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vormünder</unclear>, gwalt und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">befelchshaber</unclear>, vor etwas <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zÿts</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear>
<lb n="19"/>ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">accord</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verglÿchung</unclear> mit inen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zetrefen</unclear> begert, aber
<lb n="20"/>mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">einem</unclear> solchen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">großen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verlust</unclear>, das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inen</unclear> selbige für-
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geschlagene</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anerbottene</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mittel</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anzenemmen</unclear> nit müglich
<lb n="22"/>sondern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hochbeschwärlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gweßen</unclear>, dann inen ver-
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoffentlich</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Grüenenstein</unclear></placeName> biß zu vollkomner bezallung
<lb n="24"/>deß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gantzen</unclear> kouffs, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">recht</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">behafft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">underpfand</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sÿn</unclear> und ver-
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">blÿben</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vnd</unclear> das sÿ andern <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gemeinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schuldgloübigern</unclear> in be-
<lb n="26"/>zallung den vorzug haben söllen, vnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermein</unclear>-
<lb n="27"/>en auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zollikoffer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sÿe</unclear> nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">befuegt</unclear> noch gwaltig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsÿn</unclear>,
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">söllich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Schloß</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gerechtigkeit</unclear> vor und eh sÿ umb iren
<lb n="29"/>kouff <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vollkommen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernüegt</unclear> und unklagbar gemacht worden
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeuerkouffen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ald</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeuerendern</unclear>, er werde auch einich-
<lb n="31"/>en kouff brief <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hierum</unclear> nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uffzelegen</unclear> noch zeerscheinen
<lb n="32"/>haben, dann sÿ ine denßelbigen ohnangesehen das solches
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">offtermalen</unclear> an sÿ begert niemalen gulten wellen. Wann
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1556_5624.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ne</unclear> sich begeben das erst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungefehr</unclear> by einem jar, er
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Zollikhoffer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angeregtem</unclear> kouffbrief mit ernst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachgfraget</unclear>
<lb n="36"/>und vom <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">aman</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-119" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Balgach</placeName> im <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-64" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rynthall</unclear></placeName>, der denselbigen
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wan</unclear> sy umb den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">volkomnen</unclear> kouff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bezalt</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">besiglen</unclear> söllen,
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">danerforderet</unclear>, daruf sy <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jetzgemeldten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">aman</unclear> dange-
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">melt</unclear> und verboten, den brief <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">biß</unclear> sy gentzlich und
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allerdingen</unclear> umb den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kouffschilling</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vernuegt</unclear> und bezalt
<lb n="41"/>zuosiglen. Wann dann inen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">um</unclear>
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorgeschribne</unclear> ir anforderung, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">by</unclear> üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> getrüwen
<lb n="43"/>lieben Eydtgnossen, uf <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jetz</unclear> <date resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allernachstkomende</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mittwuchen</unclear>,
<lb n="44"/>morgens</date> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">um</unclear> 8. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uren</unclear> alda <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuerschinen</unclear> angesetzt und
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ernamset</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rechtstag</unclear>, haben sy uns um ein
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">intercession</unclear> schryben, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abgon</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zelassen</unclear>, angelangt
<lb n="47"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebäten</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">in</unclear> hoffnung desselben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">woll</unclear> und fruchtbarlich ze-
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geniessen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wellich</unclear> ir begeren <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">billichkeit</unclear> wegen
<lb n="49"/>nit wellen verweigeren. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gelangt</unclear> demnach
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">an</unclear> üch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getrüw</unclear> lieb Eydtgnossen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> fründtlich
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eydtgnössisches</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ansuochen</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pit</unclear>, die wellen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorwoll</unclear>-
<lb n="52"/>gesagtem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitrhat</unclear> und synen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitgafften</unclear>, mit
<lb n="53"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">obrigkeitlichen</unclear> hilff und befürderung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dermassen</unclear>
<lb n="54"/>entgegen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schryben</unclear>, daß sy ohne <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verlurst</unclear> und schaden
<lb n="55"/>(will sy doch sonst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">grossen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kosten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erliden</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwer</unclear>
<lb n="56"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burger</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ires</unclear> gegebnen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guettes</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorgemeldt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> ei-
<lb n="57"/>nem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hafft</unclear> genossen und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gwin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erloßt</unclear>) <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lut</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> kouff
<lb n="58"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abgericht</unclear> und der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">billichkeit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gmäß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">entlediget</unclear>, und sy
<lb n="59"/>by <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">irem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">underpfand</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schützen</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schirmen</unclear>, daß sy
<lb n="60"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">also</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">würcklich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">spüren</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rueemen</unclear> mögen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dessen</unclear>
<lb n="61"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear> inen zum besten mitgetheilten <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürschrifft</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">woll</unclear>
<lb n="62"/>und fruchtbarlich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">genossen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zehaben</unclear>, das begeren
<lb n="63"/>wir nebend erhaltung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gueter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">correspondentz</unclear>, in aller
<lb n="64"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eydtgnössischen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">affection</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uf</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">begebenden</unclear> fall hinwiderumb
<lb n="65"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuverglychen</unclear> und in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gueten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unvergessen</unclear> zublyben,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1556_5625.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="66"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geliebth</unclear>, doch in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßem</unclear> heiligen schutz und schirm wir
<lb n="67"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> trüwlich befelchen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuon</unclear>. Datum
<lb n="68"/><origDate when="1607-06-27" resp="#ner">den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">27</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Junii</unclear>. Anno 1607.</origDate>
<lb n="69"/><orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Stathalter</unclear> und Rhat
<lb n="70"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> Glarus</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1556_5626.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="71"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Denen</unclear> fromen, fürsichtigen, ersam-
<lb n="72"/>en, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyßen</unclear>, <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und
<lb n="73"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rhatt</unclear> der Statt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Sant</unclear> Gallen</orgName>,
<lb n="74"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßeren</unclear> insonders <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guoten</unclear> fründen
<lb n="75"/>und getrüwen lieben <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydgnoßenn</unclear></orgName>.
</p>
